{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0067",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "那时候我可能昏倒了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that time, I must have fainted.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "等我醒来后，打量周围环境，丈夫还绑在那，早就死透了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I came to and looked around, my husband was still tied there, already completely dead.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "穿过纷繁交错的竹林，夕阳的习惯洒在他煞白的脸上。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Through the tangled bamboo grove, the evening sun fell on his deathly white face.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我忍着哭泣声，给他解开了绳子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Holding back my sobs, I untied his ropes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "后来……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After that...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "后来我如何了呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What became of me after that?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "只有这一点，我无话可说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "On that point alone, I have nothing to say.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "无论如何我没办法杀死自己。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No matter what, I could not kill myself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "吞刀自尽也好，跳河自尽也好，各种办法我都试了，但我就是死不了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I tried every method, whether swallowing a blade or throwing myself into a river, but I simply could not die.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "今天我还活着，就是奇耻大辱。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That I am still alive today is the greatest disgrace.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "（凄然惨笑）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She laughs bleakly and miserably.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "像我这样毫无廉耻的人，还有什么出路呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What way out could there be for someone as shameless as me?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "我还有……呃……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I still have... ah...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00067",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "（突然猛地抽噎起来）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She suddenly begins to sob violently.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
